	<br><br>
	"Drink it slowly," <<he>> says. "It costs too much to throw half of it down your shirt because you're thirsty."
	<br><br>
	You take a sip. Avery watches your face. "Better than the vending-machine rubbish, isn't it?"
	<br><br>
	Surprisingly, it is.<<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<trauma -3>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
